35081","actor":{"login":"alexpearce","id":540853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDg1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/540853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce","html_url":"https://github.com/alexpearce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-05-14T12:45:50Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/841223152","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/issues/6771#issuecomment-841223152","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/6771","id":841223152,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg0MTIyMzE1Mg==","user":{"login":"alexpearce","id":540853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDg1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/540853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce","html_url":"https://github.com/alexpearce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpearce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-05-14T12:50:17Z","updated_at":"2021-05-14T12:50:17Z","body":"The problem is that the [`events` command](https://github.com/celery/celery/blob/2411504f4164ac9acfa20007038d37591c6f57e5/celery/bin/events.py#L83) [derives its arguments](https://github.com/celery/celery/blob/2411504f4164ac9acfa20007038d37591c6f57e5/celery/bin/events.py#L51) from [`CeleryDaemonCommand`](https://github.com/celery/celery/blob/8ebcce1523d79039f23da748f00bec465951de2a/celery/bin/base.py#L171), and that includes an `--executable` flag. This gets propagated through `**kwargs` until it reaches [`evcam`](https://github.com/celery/celery/blob/2411504f4164ac9acfa20007038d37591c6f57e5/celery/events/snapshot.py#L86) which does not have an `executable` argument.\r\n\r\nThis patch allows the execution to continue:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/celery/events/snapshot.py b/celery/events/snapshot.py\r\nindex 813b8db5c..d611cb280 100644\r\n--- a/celery/events/snapshot.py\r\n+++ b/celery/events/snapshot.py\r\n@@ -84,7 +84,8 @@ class Polaroid:\r\n \r\n \r\n def evcam(camera, freq=1.0, maxrate=None, loglevel=0,\r\n-          logfile=None, pidfile=None, timer=None, app=None):\r\n+          logfile=None, pidfile=None, timer=None, app=None,\r\n+          executable=None):\r\n     \"\"\"Start snapshot recorder.\"\"\"\r\n     app = app_or_default(app)\r\n```\r\n\r\nI would open a PR straight away but I'm not sure if the value of `executable` should actually be used by `evcam` for something.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/841223152/reactions","total_count":0,"+1